# Cloudflare Pages response headers (ignored by the local signalling server).

# Security headers on every response.
# - HSTS without includeSubDomains or preload until every subdomain is known to be HTTPS-only.
# - Framing limited to this site (Netcade runs its own uploaded copy, so it isn't affected).
# - The CSP is report-only: violations show in the browser console but nothing is blocked. Once a full session on the
#   stream page shows none, rename it to Content-Security-Policy to enforce it. connect-src lists stream.archv3d.com
#   and the two Workers from config.js; a ?ss= or ?control= override to another host will be reported.
# - "! Access-Control-Allow-Origin" drops the wildcard CORS header Pages adds by default; no other site reads these files.
/*
  ! Access-Control-Allow-Origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self'; media-src 'self' blob:; connect-src 'self' https://stream.archv3d.com wss://stream.archv3d.com https://archv3d-contact.james-chase-richards.workers.dev https://archv3d-control.james-chase-richards.workers.dev https://cloudflareinsights.com; frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/portfolio/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
/levels/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
/config.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
